sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sched as Backup Schedule
    participant BKP as AWS Backup / Snapshot Process
    participant EBS as EBS Volumes / EC2
    participant Vault as Backup Vault / S3
    participant CW as CloudWatch
    participant SNS as SNS (Confirm)
    participant Op as Operator

    Sched->>BKP: Trigger backup job (SCHEDULE)
    BKP->>EBS: Request point-in-time snapshot
    EBS-->>BKP: Snapshot created
    BKP->>Vault: Store recovery point (encrypted)
    BKP->>CW: Publish job status / metrics
    alt Job failed or alarm threshold breached
        CW->>SNS: Alarm state = ALARM
        SNS->>Op: Notification
    else Job succeeded
        CW-->>Op: Status visible on dashboard
    end
    Note over Vault: Lifecycle rule removes recovery points after RETENTION_PERIOD
    Op->>Vault: Periodic restore test (see Documentation/09)
